$DATUM Coupling of 8 with bis(pinacolato)diboron to give the pinacol boronic
ester 11 required very electron rich alkylphosphines and extended
reaction times (Pd2dba3/PCy3, 80°C, 44 h, 66% isolated yield)
1-Methyl-4-(8-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-10,11-dihydrodibenzo[b,f]thiepin-10-yl)piperazine
(11) mp 271-272°C. LC-MS: ELSD, 99.3%; UV, 92.4%; M+, 437.2; Rf = 0.18
(solvent C). 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ : 7.88 (s, 1H), 7.48 (d, J = 6.4
Hz, 1H), 7.41 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 1H), 7.27 (d, J = 6.4Hz, 1H), 7.20 (dt, J =
7.5Hz, J = 0.9 Hz, 1H), 7.05 (dt, J = 7.5 Hz, J = 0.9Hz, 1H), 4.02 (dd, J
= 11.3Hz, J = 4.2 Hz, 1H), 3.86 (dd, J = 13.2 Hz, J = 11.3 Hz, 1H), 3.19
(dd, J = 13.6Hz, J = 4.2 Hz, 1H), 2.29-2.75 (m, 8H), 2.26 (s, 3H), 1.31
(s, 12H). 13C NMR (CDCl3) δ : 142.4, 139.6, 139.3, 139.1, 137.3, 133.1,
130.2, 128.8, 126.6, 84.2, 66.3, 56.1, 49.1, 46.5, 34.9, 25.3, 25.2.
Anal. Calcd for C25H33BN2O2S: C, 68.80;H, 7.62;N, 6.42. Found: C, 68.63;
H, 7.60; N, 6.13.
