$DATUM Step2. Microwavable vial was charged with
(S)-2'-bromo-7'-(pyrimidin-5-yl)-5H-spiro[oxazole-4,9'-xanthen]-2-amine
(200 mg, 0.489 mmol),
2-(3,6-dihydro-2H-pyran-4-yl)-4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolane
(164 mg, 0.782 mmol), potassium carbonate (203 mg, 1.466 mmol) and Pd
(Amphos)Cl2 (17 mg, 0.024 mmol), 1,4-dioxane (2.8 mL) and water (0.4 mL)
were added , the vial was sealed and heated in microwave reactor for 1 hr
at 100°C. The mixture was diluted with ethyl acetate, filtered through
celite and concentrated, the residue was purified by flash chromatography
on 40 g RediSep column using 25-70% gradient of DCM/MeOH/NH4OH (90:10:1)
in DCM.
(R)-2'-(3,6-dihydro-2H-pyran-4-yl)-7'-(pyrimidin-5-yl)-5H-spiro[oxazole-4,9'-xanthen]-2-amine
(130 mg, 0.315 mmol, 65% yield). 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d 6) δ ppm 9.18
(s, 1 H), 9.09 (s, 2 H), 7.77 (dd, J=8.4, 2.3 Hz, 1 H), 7.68 (d, J=2.3
Hz, 1 H), 7.45 (d, J=8.5 Hz, 1 H), 7.39 (d, J=2.2 Hz, 1 H), 7.32 (d,
J=8.5 Hz, 1 H), 7.17 (d, J=8.5 Hz, 1 H), 6.44 (s, 2 H), 6.18 (dt, J=2.9,
1.5 Hz, 1 H), 4.27 - 4.34 (m, 1 H), 4.21 - 4.26 (m, 3 H), 3.84 (t, J=5.5
Hz, 2 H), 2.39 - 2.47 (m, 2 H). MS m/z = 413.0 [M+H]+.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM microwave irradiation, stereoselective, microwave vial used, sealed vial
used, microwave reactor used
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Lead Optimization and Modulation of hERG Activity in a Series of
Aminooxazoline Xanthene β-Site Amyloid Precursor Protein Cleaving Enzyme
